      "html": "<section class=\"bg-charcoal py-32 relative w-full overflow-hidden\" data-v-86808b90><section id=\"section-fde-cta\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex mx-auto w-full flex-row max-md:flex-col items-center justify-between gap-10 pointer-events-auto relative z-10\" style=\"\" data-v-86808b90 data-v-1c6297c3><h2 class=\"max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl text-chalk font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight max-md:text-center\" data-v-86808b90>Ready to build in-house, without the burden?</h2><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"pointer-events-auto\" data-v-86808b90><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-transparent text-chalk bg-slate-dark shadow-button hover:bg-portal-surface hover:text-chalk font-medium text-sm leading-normal py-3.5 px-5\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Let's chat</span></button></a></section></section>"
